VTID-05545 (agentic-delivery/cutover): commands run and what they showed. Paths are shown as <worktree>. Nothing here touched AWS, GitHub, GitLab or any
live system: the scripts were run against stand-ins, and the only network use was the Node 20 download for the whole-suite run.

